# Every authored file is UTF-8 without a BOM and uses LF line endings.
# .editorconfig states the same rule for editors; this file makes it hold for Git.
#
# `eol=lf` is declared explicitly instead of relying on `text=auto` alone, so that a
# Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true cannot reintroduce CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
